 Brother","released":"2026-11-28T18:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:45:00Z","overview":"The Power of Veto is on the line, will it be used to save one of the nominees? Plus, it's a shocking first Veto meeting of the summer.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_BigBrother_us","title":"Big Brother","released":"2026-11-28T19:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:45:00Z","overview":"It's the inaugural BB Blockbuster! Who will win their way off the Chopping Block? Will it be Amy, Zae, or Kelley who becomes the first evicted? Plus, the Queen of Quarrels goes toe-to-toe with Zae.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_BigBrother_us","title":"Big Brother","released":"2026-11-28T20:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:45:00Z","overview":"A new Head of Household will take power!","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_BigBrother_us","title":"Big Brother","released":"2026-11-28T21:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:15:00Z","overview":"It's an epic ninety minutes of BB action! We got drama, all star cameos, and powers unleashed.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_BigBrother_us","title":"Big Brother","released":"2026-11-28T23:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:15:00Z","overview":"Will, Amy, and Adrian compete in the BB Block Buster! Who will be saved from the Block? And who will be the next evicted? Plus, BB legends Taylor and Derrick unlock some big moves!","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_BigBrother_us","title":"Big Brother","released":"2026-11-29T00:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:15:00Z","overview":"Previous BB winners Taylor Hale and Derrick Levasseur host the first ever Big Brother: Unlocked!","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_BigBrother_us"